{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An experimental work simulator where all you do is type simple data into spreadsheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889500/extras/02a75883013670f6ff0534e41d0e7740.avif?t=1753156077\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889500/extras/1a6da48a5aa2accd091ed1ee755384b4.poster.avif?t=1753156077\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889500/extras/1a6da48a5aa2accd091ed1ee755384b4.webm?t=1753156077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889500/extras/1a6da48a5aa2accd091ed1ee755384b4.mp4?t=1753156077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the true joy and zen of a spreadsheet job without the worry of deadlines, bills, or deeper meanings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889500/extras/3e6228b532272407d94c52adf3c9e97a.avif?t=1753156077\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889500/extras/0c5a54376b446a6f9bc2d9503a59786b.poster.avif?t=1753156077\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889500/extras/0c5a54376b446a6f9bc2d9503a59786b.webm?t=1753156077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889500/extras/0c5a54376b446a6f9bc2d9503a59786b.mp4?t=1753156077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get lost in the rhythm of your typing as you fill your 1.000 quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prove humanity's strong will and finish this modern herculean task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889500/extras/446299bebbc23090370675f25710e6f7.avif?t=1753156077\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 90s inspired aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soothing sound of rain easing you to the spreadsheet rhythm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Selected classical music as a non-intrusive soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay so simple a baby could do it, but only a strong will could finish it</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889500?t=1753156077","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889500?t=1753156077","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889500/6ca08534b1e002aa79240f6e1a81fbd899de2d27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753156077","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889500/6ca08534b1e002aa79240f6e1a81fbd899de2d27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753156077","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An experimental work simulator where all you do is type simple data into spreadsheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=